{penalty to discourage overfitting}\n\\end{align*}\n```\n\n## Lists\n\n### My suggestion:\n\n-   SINDy: some examples (simple to complex)\n    - ODE problem\n    - PDE problem\n    - building complex candidate libraries\n    - noisy data\n    - sparse data\n\n### Are you interested in: \n\n- SINDy: control problem?\n- PySR: explain a neural net?\n\n## References\n\n::: hidden\n@rudy2017\n\n@ye\n:::\n\n",
